# Default PHP modules installed on ALL RHEL targets via the Remi repository.
#
# One module package name per line. Blank lines and lines beginning with '#'
# are ignored. Inline comments (text after a module name) are also stripped.
# These defaults are merged with config/rhel9 or config/rhel10 overrides and
# the comma-separated list supplied at pipeline runtime.

php-cli
php-fpm
php-common
php-mbstring
php-xml
php-mysqlnd
php-pdo
php-gd
php-intl
php-opcache
php-process
php-bcmath
php-pecl-zip
php-ldap
php-soap